Name":"GlobalID","isEditable":true,"label":"GlobalID","visible":false},{"fieldName":"Shape__Area","isEditable":true,"label":"Shape__Area","visible":false},{"fieldName":"Shape__Length","isEditable":true,"label":"Shape__Length","visible":false},{"fieldName":"ADRES","isEditable":true,"label":"ADRES","visible":false},{"fieldName":"TYPE_KELDER","isEditable":true,"label":"TYPE_KELDER","visible":false}],"title":""},"popupEnabled":false},{"_uid":"09980d59f9b","url":"https://geocoder.arcgisonline.nl/arcgis/rest/services/Geocoder_NL_RD/GeocodeServer","singleLineFieldName":"SingleLine","name":"Adressen","placeholder":"Adres of plaats zoeken","maxResults":6,"maxSuggestions":6,"suggestionsEnabled":true,"minSuggestCharacters":1,"withinViewEnabled":false,"countryCode":"","zoomScale":null}],"activeSourceIndex":-1},"title":"Werfkelderkaart met interne koppelingen","customHeader":false,"splash":true,"sidebarExpanded":true,"activePanel":"details","layerListPanel":true,"bookmarksPanel":false,"layerEditPanel":false,"detailsContent":"<p><span style=\"color:hsl(0, 75%, 60%);\"><strong>Let op: Het Wervenkadaster is verhuisd.</strong></span></p><p>Het Wervenkadaster is verhuist naar een nieuwe omgeving. Ga naar <a href=\"https://kaart.utrecht.nl/?@Wervenkadaster\">https://kaart.utrecht.nl/?@Wervenkadaster</a> of klik op <a href=\"https://kaart.utrecht.nl/?@Wervenkadaster\" target=\"_blank\">deze link</a> om het nieuwe Wervenkadaster te openen.</p><p>Medewerkers van de Gemeente Utrecht kunnen <a href=\"https://kaart.utrecht.nl/admin/login?redirect=../?@Wervenkadaster\" target=\"_blank\">deze link</a> gebruiken.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\">Deze kaart is opgesteld om alle bekende kelders onder de openbare weg in Utrecht inzichtelijk te maken.&nbsp;</span></i></p><p><i><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\">Aan deze kaart kunnen geen rechten worden ontleend.</span></i></p><p><i><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\">In de linker menubalk kun je de volgende dingen vinden:</span></i></p><ul><li><i>Onder <strong>Legenda </strong>zie je de betekenis van de kleuren van de actieve lagen</i></li><li><i>Bij <strong>Details </strong>staat meer informatie over de kaart. Daar ben je nu.</i></li><li><i>Via <strong>Kaartlagen </strong>kun je:</i><ul><li><i>Een laag zoeken via de zoekfunctie. <img src=\"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1714632670868_detailsContent_textEditor_1714632670758.png\"></i></li><li><i>Door de lagen navigeren door middel van het pijltje <strong>&gt;</strong>. <img src=\"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1714632664195_detailsContent_textEditor_1714632664085.png\"></i></li><li><i>De lagen verschuiven door middel van de 6 puntjes. <img src=\"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1714632657729_detailsContent_textEditor_1714632657620.png\"></i></li><li><i>Een laag aan- en uitzetten door middel van het oogje (deze verschijnt als je met je muis boven de laag gaat staan). <img src=\"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1714632645938_detailsContent_textEditor_1714632645828.png\"></i></li></ul></li><li><i>Onder <strong>Info </strong>staat informatie over het in de kaart geselecteerde object.</i></li><li><i>Via <strong>Filter </strong>kun je de kaartlagen filteren.</i></li></ul><p><i><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\">Het team wervenkadaster doet haar best om de informatie op deze kaart kloppend en actueel te houden. Komt u iets tegen wat niet klopt of sterk verouderd is, dan vinden wij het fijn als u ons dat laat weten. Neem contact op via </span></i><a href=\"mailto:Wervenkadaster@Utrecht.nl\" target=\"_blank\"><i><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\">Wervenkadaster@Utrecht.nl</span></i></a></p>","filterPanel":true,"basemapGallery":false,"enableFeatureSearchScale":false,"popupHover":false,"compassWidget":false,"locateWidget":false,"measure":false,"keyboardShortcuts":true,"disableScroll":false,"scalebarDualMode":false,"extentSelector":true,"enableHighlightColor":true,"enableHighlightHaloColor":true,"basemapToggle":false,"share":false,"customUrlParam":{"layers":[{"id":"19585197d7a-layer-29","fields":["KLDR_ID"],"fieldOrder":[]}]},"panelSize":"m","theme":"light","customTheme":{"applySharedTheme":false,"applyPresetTheme":true,"font":"Arial","appFont":"Arial","logo":"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712215963941_Utrecht_Logo.png","logoLink":"https://www.utrecht.nl/","logoScale":"m","preset":null,"themes":{"primary":{"type":"primary","background":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"},"secondary":{"type":"secondary","background":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"},"accent":{"type":"accent","background":"#2964A3","text":"#ffffff"}}},"uploads":["https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1714632645938_detailsContent_textEditor_1714632645828.png","https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1714632657729_detailsContent_textEditor_1714632657620.png","https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1714632664195_detailsContent_textEditor_17146